    <briefdescription>
<para>Operator-visible sink for scraper diagnostic events. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Implementations must be thread-safe. The default <ref refid="classthemis_1_1scraper_1_1_null_scraper_diagnostic_sink" kindref="compound">NullScraperDiagnosticSink</ref> is a no-op suitable for unit tests. The <ref refid="classthemis_1_1scraper_1_1_listening_scraper_diagnostic_sink" kindref="compound">ListeningScraperDiagnosticSink</ref> supports injecting listener callbacks for integration tests and metrics. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
